{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_st03",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_st03",
  "title": "靈魂盡頭",
  "storyCode": "BB-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "33b3badde712d7adf7177e96d47498a219b18b33885c30b14cd911abd8b4683c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "抹除記憶。對特蕾西婭來說，她亦缺少足夠的經驗。\n更不必論，她此刻不得不面對一種她知之甚少的思維。\n她不知道會遇見什麼，也無法預料是否會帶來危險，但她並沒有退縮的餘地。\n這已是她生命最後的決定。\n她走在博士的記憶中，無數的記憶被拆解成為絲線消散。\n記憶在消逝。無聲無息。\n她走過了從未見識，也無法認知的世界。\n如此輝煌的文明為何會終結？\n如流星般璀璨的天才們又為何對這個終極問題苦苦求索而無解？\n抵抗是否沒有意義？團結是否只是空想？\n泰拉的未來是否已然注定？她所愛的家園呢？\n她所愛的人呢？\n她沒有答案。她找不到答案。\n她只能繼續漫步於記憶散去後的虛無。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "終於，她看到了熟悉的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家的熱情讓你無所適從嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼來了，凱爾希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是慶祝你又一次大勝的慶典，難道我不該到場嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道的，我很久沒有……我們那時候，能慶祝的日子不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該如何慶祝，我已經有些生疏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，你會慢慢熟悉的。巴別塔會成為一個新的開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，我們應該好好慶祝一番。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭看到凱爾希抬手拍了拍博士的後背，輕輕將那人推向等候已久的人群。\n有太多人擠過來了，一雙雙手伸向前，爭先恐後想要同博士握握手，拍拍博士的肩膀。\n還有些個子很高的傢伙，膽子很大，竟然直接將手放在博士的腦袋上狠狠揉了揉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我替手下的冒失向您道歉，博士，我剛想阻止他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我的手臂受傷了……根本來不及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係……傷勢如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恢復得不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜，今夜有很多飲品你都沒辦法享用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，博士，我會代這傢伙多喝上幾杯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是您最後果斷地變招突襲，我們恐怕都要落進包圍網裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來，敬您，我們可得好好喝上幾杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕我的酒量會讓你失望，Ace先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_050",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓一讓，讓一讓，我都要看不見今天的主角了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_050",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼多人，我還是第一次覺得這間指揮室這麼小，要不要之後幫你擴建一下啊？外面可還有好多人提著好吃的趕過來呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，大家都在為您所帶來的勝利而歡呼，但您看上去有些……不自在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為自己遮掩得不錯。咳，只是在人群中覺得緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，小心，別往前擠了。阿米婭，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！快和我來，我和特蕾西婭小姐為你準備了烤蛋糕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，烤箱太燙了，還把我的手指燙了一個水泡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝……呃！這沒事嗎？誰有燙傷膏……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一聲輕輕的咳嗽響起，人群應聲向兩邊散開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭看到了一個身著白裙的女人擦肩而過，笑著向博士伸出一隻手，手上有未愈的針刺傷口。\n那是她自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喜悅淡去，記憶淡去，耳邊的聲音淡去。\n特蕾西婭抹除這段自己也無比熟悉的記憶，接著向前走去。\n她看到了一段自己從未在PRTS中看到的記錄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_abyss_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調用影像功能。啟用管理員權限加密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "影像編號<color=#FF4200>（0091_admin）</color>……添加主題：<color=#FF4200>（這是留給你的）</color>。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啟動記錄……開始錄影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我沒有堅持到你醒來，你會看到這段影片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在一切塵埃落定之前，我會留在這裡，留在最安全的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我做完所有的一切之後，我會在沉默中消失……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "消失在所有恨我的人面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的心中時刻有一個聲音提醒我，拷問我——“我是誰？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我們自身的守望者？還是後來文明的背叛者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經無法認清我自己——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "查看所有我留下的記錄之後，你會得出一個答案。但至少此刻，我已不再猶豫自己該做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當你醒來，我應該已經消失在你的過去，不會再出現在我們約定的未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我希望……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……記錄暫停。刪除剛才的所有內容。我……還需要一點時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她沒有猶豫，沒有嘆息，只是默默繼續做著該做的事情。\n特蕾西婭越走越深，靠近了埋藏在更深處的回憶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g4_rmbtwild_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要你們聯絡最近的救援隊！失事的運輸隊車輛上有雷姆必拓的標誌，這是你們的隊伍……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽到裡面還有倖存者的聲音！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊聲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滋——我們已經聯繫上，但是從最近的採礦地塊趕到現場還需要時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊聲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽您的回報，那裡曾發生過搶劫案，我們同樣要通知武裝安保，讓他們立刻出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……武裝安保……但雷姆必拓對沒有家庭支持的感染者……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "堅持一下……我現在就能把你拉出來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千萬不要睡著……嘶……好孩子，把手伸過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可……我……好累……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的名字是什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "名字……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "媽媽……叫我……阿米婭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，堅持一下，抓緊我的手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……抓住你了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會放手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "記憶破碎。\n這裡就是特蕾西婭的終點，博士記憶的終點——\n“特蕾西婭……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能，明明所有的記憶都已經……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“特蕾西婭。”\n她循著聲音，來到了一處虛無之前，聲音從虛無之後傳來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是哪裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你終於走到了這裡，我在等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很少有人會這麼叫我，他們喜歡稱呼我的團隊代號——“預言家”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……預言家……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，凱爾希信任的，其實是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "預言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很對不起凱爾希。但沒辦法，我確實深陷一個避無可避的陽謀之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "預言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直在這裡看著你，看著你為希望奔走，看著你為背叛而痛苦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "預言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像看著曾經的我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的你只是博士情感燃燒後的殘渣，我沒辦法在這樣的情況下，單獨保留下你的情感和記憶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "預言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經來到了終點，做你該做的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "預言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你相信我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……也許有些遲了，不過，很高興見到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "預言家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1360_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也很高興見到你，特蕾西婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "預言家走向了遠方無盡的麥田，消失在其中。\n氣流肆虐過麥田，嘩嘩作響，空間中最後的景象也崩解四散，直到翻出絲線的盡頭。\n特蕾西婭牽住它，很快，絲線開始逐漸失去光澤，碎成粉末。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了說再見的時候了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "未來，我們還會再見的吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希……阿米婭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭鬆開了手中最後的線頭，目睹它如星光般散開，消逝。\n她邁開步走去，走向了希望……\n走向了死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
